  "bio": "With a specialized focus on neotraditional, black & gray, and traditional styles, Pawel Jankowski stands out as a remarkably skilled tattoo artist in Deventer, Netherlands. His attention to detail and mastery of various tattooing techniques is evident in both his custom and pre-drawn work, which can be seen at 71Tattoo Enschede from Wednesday to Saturday. Whether you're seeking a unique design or a classic piece, Pawel's exceptional talent ensures that your ink will be a work of art.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Deventer, Overijssel, Netherlands"
